---
import Fn from '../primitives/Fn.astro';
---

<section class="section cpu" id="cpu" aria-labelledby="cpu-title">
  <div class="wrap cpu__grid">
    <header class="head cpu__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Nova on the CPU</p>
      <h2 id="cpu-title" class="display-2">A wavefront path tracer on every core</h2>
    </header>

    <dl class="cpu__rows">
      <div>
        <dt>Embree 4</dt>
        <dd>
          Rays are traced through Embree 4 with AVX2. Instances are Embree instance arrays with one transform each, and
          deforming meshes refit their BVH instead of rebuilding it.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Wavefront integrator</dt>
        <dd>
          Rays move through queues: generate, intersect, shade, shadow. Owen-scrambled Sobol sequences, multiple
          importance sampling of lights and BSDFs, and a light tree for scenes with many lights.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>SIMD shading VM</dt>
        <dd>
          Materials compile to bytecode for a SIMD shading VM. A value edit never recompiles; a structural edit
          recompiles one material in about 0.1&nbsp;ms.<Fn id="shading-edit" />
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="cpu__rate">
        <dt class="num">21–38</dt>
        <dd>million rays per second on the reference scenes, on eight cores<Fn id="cpu-rays" /></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cpu__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: 40px var(--gap-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .cpu__head {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .cpu__rows {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cpu__rows > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
    gap: 8px 24px;
    padding-block: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cpu__rows dt {
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 24px;
  }
  .cpu__rows dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: var(--t-14);
    line-height: 20px;
  }
  .cpu__rate {
    align-items: baseline;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cpu__rate dt {
    font-size: var(--h3);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cpu__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .cpu__rows > div {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
